      "message": "Hi,\n\nYou have two options:\n\n1) Upstream your clock drivers and propose bringing back these traces.\n\n2) For out-of-tree drivers, you can create a new out-of-tree clock trace driver and then update your drivers to use those traces. This will allow you to collect the same traces for your out-of-tree drivers. As a reference, you can refer to similar changes we made to the Pixel 6 drivers on android-mainline here:\n\nhttps://r.android.com/3703475\n\nYou can refer to the whole clocktrace topic to see how the new trace driver was enabled and used in other out-of-tree Pixel drivers:\n\nhttps://android-review.git.corp.google.com/q/topic:%22clocktrace%22\n\n\nFeel free to file a bug if you want to discuss this in more detail.",
